---
permalink: /admin/health/
title: "Health | Admin"
bodyScripts:
  - src: "/scripts/admin-health.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/contact-widget.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/palette.js"
    type: "module"
---
<section class="app-page">

  {% include "chrome/admin-sections.njk" %}

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Health</h1>
  <p class="text-brand-muted mb-4 max-w-prose">
    Everything that keeps tzortzoglou.eu running, at a glance. Open any section for the detail.
  </p>

  {# The answer to "does anything need me?" before any detail. Redrawn as each section lands. #}
  <div id="summary" class="hc-summary mb-8" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="hc-chip">Checking…</span></div>

  <div id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mb-6 text-sm"></div>

  {# --- machines ----------------------------------------------------------
     From Beszel, through /admin/machines. A card each, its edge coloured by its
     worst reading, which the pill names in words. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Machines</h2>
  <p id="machinesAge" class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4">From Beszel, refreshed every minute.</p>
  <div id="machines" class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3 mb-10">
    <p class="sr-only">Loading…</p>
    <div class="card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skel h-40"></span></div>
    <div class="card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skel h-40"></span></div>
    <div class="card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skel h-40"></span></div>
  </div>

  {# --- services ---------------------------------------------------------- #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Services</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4">Checked when this page loaded.</p>
  <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-10">
    <li class="card">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-brand-text">API</h3>
        <span id="apiState" class="status-pill status-pill--unknown">Checking…</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">api.tzortzoglou.eu</p>
      <p id="apiTime" class="hc-big mt-4">&nbsp;</p>
      <p id="apiDetail" class="text-sm text-brand-muted">&nbsp;</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-brand-text">App</h3>
        <span id="appState" class="status-pill status-pill--unknown">Checking…</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">app.tzortzoglou.eu</p>
      <p id="appDetail" class="mt-4 text-sm text-brand-muted">&nbsp;</p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  {# --- restarts ----------------------------------------------------------
     The one thing deploy history cannot answer. A deploy that succeeded and a container that has
     restarted eleven times since look identical in GitHub Actions. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">API restarts</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4 max-w-prose">
    Last 30 days, one square a day. A restart with a new build is a deploy; one with the same build
    means something fell over. Press a square for that day.
  </p>
  <div id="boots" class="card mb-10">
    <p class="sr-only">Loading…</p>
    <div class="space-y-4" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skel h-6"></span></div>
  </div>

  {# --- deploys -----------------------------------------------------------
     One strip per pipeline. A failed run names the step that failed, because that is the one
     thing worth knowing before opening the log. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Deploys</h2>
  <p id="deployAge" class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4"></p>
  <div id="deploys" class="card">
    <p class="sr-only">Loading…</p>
    <div class="space-y-4" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skel h-6"></span><span class="skel h-6"></span><span class="skel h-6"></span></div>
  </div>

</section>
